# ccenv's own state directories, created at its CCENV_ROOT -- which
# README.md documents as this repo itself when cloned to ~/.ccenv (the
# default). profiles/ and profile hold symlinks/pointers to registered
# environments, and homes/ can contain real Claude Code credentials and
# history for any profile created via `ccenv add <name> --new`.
/profiles
/profile
/homes
